Please read AGENTS.md in the root directory for all AI instructions, coding rules, naming conventions, database patterns, and testing requirements. It is the single source of truth for this repository.

Key points:
- Always start by reading docs/PRD.md and docs/RFC.md for context
- Use the Safe Commands section for all operations
- Follow Naming Conventions exactly when adding new files
- All inventory mutations must use DB::transaction() + lockForUpdate()
- Run `php artisan test` before committing
- Update docs/Documentation.md when code changes
